@startuml
title Relational Access V1 - L3 Idempotent Route
autonumber

participant "RoutedMyBatisIdempotencyRepository" as Repo
participant "StorageRoutingIdempotencyPhysicalRouteResolver" as Route
participant "StorageRouteContext" as Context
participant "MyBatisAccessResolver" as AccessResolver
participant "MyBatisIdempotencyRepository" as Delegate
participant "IdempotencyMapper" as Mapper

Repo -> Route : resolvePoint(storageContext, namespace, key)
Route -> Context : current()

alt Direct route
  Route -> Route : reuse shardInfo
  Route -> Route : remap idempotency physical table
  Route --> Repo : physical DB key + physical table
else ShardingSphere-JDBC / Proxy
  Route -> Route : keep middleware mode
  Route --> Repo : logical Access key + idempotency logical table
end

Repo -> AccessResolver : resolve(dataSourceKey)
AccessResolver --> Repo : MyBatisAccess
Repo -> Delegate : create/cache(access, tableName)
Repo -> Delegate : tryAcquire / markSuccess / find
Delegate -> Mapper : mapped SQL

note right of Route
Middleware Access key chooses an application runtime.
It does not select a ShardingSphere physical shard.
end note
@enduml
